<title>USA: TABLE - Johnston Q2 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Johnston Q2 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ga. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.63   profit	 $0.21</p>
<p> Net loss		   6,483   profit	 2,306</p>
<p> Revs			87,724		   81,743</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,404		   10,731</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.48   profit	 $0.37</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,959   profit	 4,068</p>
<p> Revs		     174,502		  165,773</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,392		   10,791</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Excluding one-time charges totaling $10.2 million, mostly for restructuring, 1997 operating income was $1.3 million for the quarter and $3.8 million for the six months.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Johnston Industries Inc.</p>
